WEBVTT

00:12:27.996 --> 00:12:30.996
But it is changing the equation

00:12:30.996 --> 00:12:32.996
of what's rational

00:12:32.996 --> 00:12:35.996
in sexual decision-making.

00:12:35.996 --> 00:12:37.996
So, what we've got --

00:12:37.996 --> 00:12:39.996
some people say, "Oh, it doesn't matter very much

00:12:39.996 --> 00:12:42.996
because, actually, treatment is effective prevention

00:12:42.996 --> 00:12:44.996
because it lowers your viral load and therefore

00:12:44.996 --> 00:12:46.996
makes it more difficult to transmit HIV."

00:12:46.996 --> 00:12:49.996
So, if you look at the viremia thing again,

00:12:49.996 --> 00:12:51.996
if you do start treatment when you're sick,

00:12:51.996 --> 00:12:54.996
well, what happens? Your viral load comes down.

00:12:54.996 --> 00:12:57.996
But compared to what? What happens if you're not on treatment?

00:12:58.996 --> 00:13:00.996
Well, you die,